WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,590
You sit in the back and I'll take you

2
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:04,620
Come on, I'll take you

3
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:08,540
Come on, be quick and get on the bus

4
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:16,140
I hold on tight

5
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:31,780
Hurry up, let's go

6
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:32,780
My aunt has arrived long ago

7
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:37,910
I sent someone to pick up Lan Yi early.

8
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:39,910
My baby Xia is here

9
00:00:39,910 --> 00:00:40,910
Let me kiss you quickly

10
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:42,910
Auntie, this is at someone else’s house. Please be careful.

11
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:43,910
What other people's house

12
00:00:43,910 --> 00:00:46,910
From now on, it will be your grandpa and me
